WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.849 --> 00:00:25.409
So I'm getting more and more calls from viewers
and listeners horrified that Donald Trump

00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:29.279
is going to cheat his way to reelection later
this year.

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:33.760
And your fears are real and that Donald Trump
will try to cheat.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.239
The question is whether he will succeed.

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:38.350
And what we mean by cheating.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.940
And Heather Digby Parton has a really great
article in Salon about this.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.399
And I'll mention a few of her points and a
few of mine.

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:50.789
She points out that as real as Joe Biden's
leads in the polls right now may well be,

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:53.460
Donald Trump will try to cheat.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:57.329
And it is going to take everything we have
to keep him from reelection.

00:00:57.329 --> 00:00:59.319
Now, what do I mean by cheating?

00:00:59.319 --> 00:01:01.649
And I want to be really careful here by cheating.

00:01:01.649 --> 00:01:08.690
I mean that failures and vulnerabilities in
the system will lead to Donald Trump maybe

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:14.009
being reelected even when a Biden win would
be the will of the people.

00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:16.729
So I'll give you an example of what I mean
by that.

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:18.480
Trump's opposition to vote by mail.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:23.830
This has been a big thing over the last three
or four weeks, whether we call it literal

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:29.600
cheating, legal cheating or simply suppressing
the will of the people.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:36.060
Trump trying to win by making it so fewer
people vote is cheating in the sense that

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.520
it cheats democracy.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.219
It circumvents the will of the people.

00:01:40.219 --> 00:01:44.590
Yesterday I told you about, you know, all
the garbage math that we're going to be hit

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:49.729
by in the coming months where people who don't
even understand growth rates and percentages

00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:55.200
are going to quickly be told that we're seeing
the fastest growing economy in history in

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:00.140
the upcoming third quarter, when what we're
seeing is the start of a recovery from the

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:03.149
largest declines of the last hundred years.

00:02:03.149 --> 00:02:09.459
So that's not literally cheating, but it is
bamboozling vulnerable people with mathematical

00:02:09.459 --> 00:02:10.619
lies.

00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:13.230
Another example, Trump has an attorney general
in place,

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.700
William Barr.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:20.530
William Barr is made it clear that he has
absolutely no moral and ethical scruples whatsoever.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.920
He will stop at nothing to help Donald Trump.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.850
Now, you might think, well, hold on a second,
David.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:30.010
William Barr did recently say he's not going
to prosecute Obama in the fake Obama gate

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.010
scandal.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.530
He must realize that that's not okay.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.170
He's doing the ethical thing.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:40.410
No, all that means is that William Barr recognizes
that in the large scheme of things, a good

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.979
prosecuting Barack Obama for the bogus Obama
gate fiasco.

00:02:43.979 --> 00:02:45.750
First of all, there's no crime Obama committed.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.820
So what could you really prosecute him for?

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:55.660
He recognizes that it's not the right tool
to use to try to propel Donald Trump to reelection.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:03:00.260
Election Day is going to be absolute mayhem
in red states.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.230
You're going to see people show up to vote
and told that

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.910
they're not registered due to voter purges.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.870
You're going to see the polling places that
are open.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.410
We don't know how many it's going to be.

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.480
It'll depend on the virus.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.950
You're going to see some polling places completely
overloaded in key swing states like Wisconsin

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:20.190
and Pennsylvania and Florida.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:26.600
You're going to see some so-called patriots
showing up to do security at polling places,

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:31.340
which, of course, will be hugely intimidating
to certain voters.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:38.169
You're going to see even in states that go
for vote by mail, a concerted effort to disqualify

00:03:38.169 --> 00:03:40.450
ballots for bogus reasons.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:46.509
You're going to see Corona virus probably
keep more Democrats at home than Republicans

00:03:46.509 --> 00:03:52.190
because Democrats are more likely to understand
and accept the medical science of corona virus

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.509
when Republicans are more likely to ignore
it.

00:03:54.509 --> 00:03:57.940
So understand that we have an election coming
up.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.750
And it's not unique in the sense,

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.870
but it's exacerbated acutely in this particular
election.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:07.980
We have an election coming up where one candidate
wants to reduce the number of people that

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.030
vote and the other candidate wants as many
people as possible to vote.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:17.380
Lastly, understand that this is only partially
because of Corona virus.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:23.970
Even before the Corona virus pandemic in 2017,
there was a poll done asking if Trump suggested

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.380
postponing the election.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.870
Would you support it?

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.980
More than half of Republicans said they would.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:35.430
More than half of Republicans before the virus
said we would support postponing the election,

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.760
just on Trump's say so.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:39.320
It's not going to happen this year.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.320
Remember that.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.620
It's up to the states.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.040
There is not a federal election in November.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:50.030
What we have is an election of a federal government
position, president of the United States done

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:52.510
by 50 individual state elections.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.380
Each state election is administered

00:04:54.380 --> 00:05:00.840
independently, but the anti-democratic tendencies
of the Republican Party have been clear for

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.280
a long time.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.350
It's scaled up because Donald Trump knows
it's not thinks he knows.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:12.570
And he's right that if he can keep disproportionately
Democrats from voting, including by blocking

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:17.810
vote by mail, he is in a much better position
to potentially defeat Joe Biden in November.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:18.810
So what do we have to do?

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.090
Well, number one.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.520
We've got to completely overwhelm the voting
booths in November.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:27.090
And I hate that it's the only sure fire method.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:32.690
But if we completely overwhelm the voting
booths and vote by mail, absentee ballots,

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:38.810
everything that ensures that we win, Trump
can only cheat so much.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:45.130
And if we don't allow him to prevent people
from voting one way or another, that is very,

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.130
very important.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:50.830
Now, secondly, we've got to keep pushing on
vote by mail, particularly in certain

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.830
states.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.620
And I'm going to address that a little bit
more in the next segment.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:59.139
But understand, if we overwhelm the voting
booths, he can't win.

00:05:59.139 --> 00:05:59.289
We just need to do it.

